@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### Login como ADMIN (Laura) para probar admin endpoints
# @name adminLoginForAdminEndpoints
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "laura@correo.com",
  "password": "laura123"
}

### (Opcional) Revocar su token actual para generar un registro
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLoginForAdminEndpoints.response.body.token}}

### Listar tokens revocados (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/revoked-tokens?page=1&pageSize=10&orderBy=revoked_at&orderDir=DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLoginForAdminEndpoints.response.body.token}}
